    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes",
        "text": "High Priest, how is it looking?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_074",
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "High Priest",
        "text": "I have to say, that cannon was so astoundingly loud, I almost got blown out of the thing when it fired!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_074",
            "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes",
        "text": "I'm asking you about the Big, Ugly Thing."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_074",
            "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "High Priest",
        "text": "I was just sharing my personal situation with you. It went exactly as we expected. Firing the cannon in succession caused it to overheat."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "High Priest",
        "text": "But it went very well. Yes, I have to say, it was very effective! Despite the fact that it gave me quite the scare!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "High Priest",
        "text": "In any case, we will have to fix it up after we get back."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_074",
            "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes",
        "text": "Yeah, the ceremony happened way too quickly. The Big Ugly wasn't ready yet."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes",
        "text": "I was hoping to wait until we finished it before talking to the other tribes about the ceremony, but they'd already gone ahead with it."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_074",
            "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "High Priest",
        "text": "It's okay. It all turned out fine!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "High Priest",
        "text": "I still remember how shocked everyone was when they first saw the Big, Ugly Thing! Haha, that was so funny!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_074",
            "name2": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes",
        "text": "Yeah, we've accomplished our goal."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_074",
            "name2": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "High Priest",
        "text": "This will set in motion a new order! A new era! Yes, an age of machines! That has such a nice ring to it!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "High Priest",
        "text": "What do you think of the 'Age of Big Ugly'? Oh, maybe the 'Age of the High Priest' too. Yes, that sounds almost as cool as I do."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_074",
            "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes",
        "text": "Let's just call it the age of machines."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_074",
            "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "High Priest",
        "text": "Sheesh, you have a lot going for you, but you're still behind the times. Now that you've learned what it's like outside, you should try to expand your horizons!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "High Priest",
        "text": "Here, check out my outfit. Don't you think it's trendy? Looks smart?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_074",
            "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes",
        "text": "You're so short, I can't even see it. What does trendy mean, anyway?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_074",
            "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "High Priest",
        "text": "Argh, never mind. My mistake. I shouldn't have brought this up. But no matter. I'll pick out some clothes befitting you, our next Great Chief."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_074",
            "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes",
        "text": "I don't mind how I dress. Anyway, I just got word from the tribesmen who stayed behind. They managed to steal an engine."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_074",
            "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "High Priest",
        "text": "What? Really?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_074",
            "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes",
        "text": "Yes, apparently they got it from the transport Gavial used to get here."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_074",
            "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "High Priest",
        "text": "Wonderful! I can't wait to take a good look at it!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "High Priest",
        "text": "Oh, come to think of it, I can go check it out right now! I'll see you later!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_416_zumama_1#5"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes",
        "text": "The High Priest's the same as ever."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
