    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_071",
            "name2": "avg_npc_070",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A",
        "text": "Hey, who was the Liberi talking to the leader?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_071",
            "name2": "avg_npc_070",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria B",
        "text": "What, you new here? That's the High Priest! You know, the Big Ugly's pilot!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_071",
            "name2": "avg_npc_070",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A",
        "text": "What? I want to pilot the Big Ugly!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_071",
            "name2": "avg_npc_070",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria B",
        "text": "Give it up. Before it was finished, that thing used to explode just about every day. So many hands got caught up in the explosions, in the end no one wanted to pilot it."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria B",
        "text": "Then the High Priest came along, and he somehow managed to come back alive every time it blew up!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_071",
            "name2": "avg_npc_070",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A",
        "text": "No kidding? He's that good?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_071",
            "name2": "avg_npc_070",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria B",
        "text": "Yeah, I've got no idea what tribe he's from, but we all call him the High Priest now!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_071"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A",
        "text": "Hm? Isn't that Yogi over there? Hey, Yogi."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_070"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yogi",
        "text": "Oh, it's you two."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_071",
            "name2": "avg_npc_070",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A",
        "text": "I thought you were taking care of your brother. Where is he?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_071",
            "name2": "avg_npc_070",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yogi",
        "text": "Actually, I'm going to the leader to talk about that."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_071",
            "name2": "avg_npc_070",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.3,
            "xstrength": 10,
            "ystrength": 12,
            "vibration": 30,
            "randomness": 90,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A",
        "text": "You idiot, she's the Great Chief now!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_071",
            "name2": "avg_npc_070",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yogi",
        "text": "Oh, I'm going to the Great Chief."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_070",
            "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes",
        "text": "What's the matter?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_070",
            "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yogi",
        "text": "Great Chief, my brother has caught the Stone Disease."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_070",
            "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes",
        "text": "Speak Sargonian."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_070",
            "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yogi",
        "text": "Oh, yes, sorry. I'm not very good at speaking it yet."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_070",
            "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes",
        "text": "...How did he catch the disease?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_070",
            "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yogi",
        "text": "He wanted to mine more ores and went deeper into the mine. He didn't even listen to me when I told him not to..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_070",
            "name2": "char_416_zumama_1#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes",
        "text": "That idiot! Didn't I tell you to stay away from the mine's depths?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes",
        "text": "Where is he now?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_070",
            "name2": "char_416_zumama_1#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yogi",
        "text": "Gavial took him away for treatment."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_070",
            "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes",
        "text": "Gavial?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_070",
            "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yogi",
        "text": "Yes, it looks like Gavial actually became a doctor. My brother was in a lot of pain, but he seemed much better after she patched him up a bit."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_070",
            "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes",
        "text": "...So she really meant it when she said she's a doctor now."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_070",
            "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yogi",
        "text": "She wanted me to pass along a message too."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_070",
            "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes",
        "text": "What is it?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_070",
            "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yogi",
        "text": "She said she was coming for you. She looked angry."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_071",
            "name2": "avg_npc_070",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A",
        "text": "Hmph, I bet she's just upset our leader defeated her!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_071",
            "name2": "avg_npc_070",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria B",
        "text": "That's right, leader! What you did back there. That boom! That was amazing!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_071",
            "name2": "avg_npc_070",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A",
        "text": "You didn't call her Great Chief!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_071",
            "name2": "avg_npc_070",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria B",
        "text": "You didn't either!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_071",
            "name2": "avg_npc_070",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A",
        "text": "Get off my back, you moron! She'll always be our tribe leader!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_071",
            "name2": "avg_npc_070",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria B",
        "text": "Why don't you get off my back? I just haven't gotten used to calling her that yet!"
    },
